---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 252;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08rotation2023">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="When rates fell in 2023, banks rose 30 percent and real estate 20 percent year to date at 8 August, driving over two thirds of the VN-Index gain.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>The same two sectors, when the rate turned around</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai ngành đó khi lãi suất quay đầu</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="60" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Policy rate: +200 bps in late 2022, then four cuts (-150 bps) to 4.5% by June 2023</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi suất điều hành: +200 điểm cơ bản cuối 2022, rồi bốn lần giảm (-150 điểm) về 4,5% đến tháng 6/2023</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="109" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Banks (35% of index)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ngân hàng (35% chỉ số)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="240" y="90" width="300" height="30" rx="4" class="barg" />
      <text x="550" y="110" class="h">+30%</text>
      <text x="20" y="157" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Real estate (18% of index)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất động sản (18% chỉ số)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="240" y="138" width="200" height="30" rx="4" class="bard" />
      <text x="450" y="158" class="h">+20%</text>
      <text x="20" y="208" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Year to 8 August 2023. These two sectors drove over two-thirds of the index gain.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Từ đầu năm đến 8/8/2023. Hai ngành này tạo hơn hai phần ba mức tăng của chỉ số.</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="230" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>The VN-Index was up over 20% in the same period.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>VN-Index tăng hơn 20% cùng kỳ.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Source: VinaCapital, quoted by The Investor (August 2023). A year to date at one date, not a forecast. The same sectors that fell hardest in 2022 led the rebound.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nguồn: VinaCapital, The Investor trích (tháng 8/2023). Là mức tăng từ đầu năm tại một thời điểm, không phải dự báo. Các ngành giảm mạnh nhất 2022 dẫn dắt nhịp hồi.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08rotation2023 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
